{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1642","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Power Walking"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Sam is a kindergartener, and there are $$$n$$$ children in his group. He decided to create a team with some of his children to play \"brawl:go 2\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Sam has $$$n$$$ power-ups, the $$$i$$$-th has type $$$a_i$$$. A child's strength is equal to the number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"different"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" types among power-ups he has."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For a team of size $$$k$$$, Sam will distribute all $$$n$$$ power-ups to $$$k$$$ children in such a way that each of the $$$k$$$ children receives at least one power-up, and each power-up is given to someone."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each integer $$$k$$$ from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$, find the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"minimum"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" sum of strengths of a team of $$$k$$$ children Sam can get."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 3 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of test cases. Description of the test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 3 \\cdot 10^5$$$). "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 10^9$$$) — types of Sam's power-ups."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$3 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For every test case print $$$n$$$ integers."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The $$$k$$$-th integer should be equal to the minimum sum of strengths of children in the team of size $$$k$$$ that Sam can get."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n3\n1 1 2\n6\n5 1 2 2 2 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2 2 3 \n4 4 4 4 5 6 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"One of the ways to give power-ups to minimise the sum of strengths in the first test case: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$k = 1: \\{1, 1, 2\\}$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$k = 2: \\{1, 1\\}, \\{2\\}$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$k = 3: \\{1\\}, \\{1\\}, \\{2\\}$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"One of the ways to give power-ups to minimise the sum of strengths in the second test case: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$k = 1: \\{1, 2, 2, 2, 4, 5\\}$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$k = 2: \\{2, 2, 2, 4, 5\\}, \\{1\\}$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$k = 3: \\{2, 2, 2, 5\\}, \\{1\\}, \\{4\\}$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$k = 4: \\{2, 2, 2\\}, \\{1\\}, \\{4\\}, \\{5\\}$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$k = 5: \\{2, 2\\}, \\{1\\}, \\{2\\}, \\{4\\}, \\{5\\}$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$k = 6: \\{1\\}, \\{2\\}, \\{2\\}, \\{2\\}, \\{4\\}, \\{5\\}$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"1642B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1642/problem/B"}